{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_04_end",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_06",
  "title": "远遁",
  "storyCode": "DM-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6318f90c9369317440df07c7296c1c0554457b7ad02236b78ba0dd2d1a91d331",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巴别塔发生了什么——但凡当时和特蕾西娅殿下有所联系的萨卡兹，都会有这个疑问。\nW无疑看清了真相，但在漫长的旅途中，她只字不谈。\n我没有问，伊内丝也没有，但我觉得她会比我更接近真相。\n不知不觉之间，我已经是走在最后的那个人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，不会有问题，各支队之间保持联络。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......遵命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各位，看来我们要在这里驻扎一阵子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "先遣队观察到了天灾云，没有天灾信使在这附近，以防万一，我们只能尽可能远离天灾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "无论如何，不能冒这个风险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......天灾吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很少亲眼见识到在荒野肆虐的天灾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过卡兹戴尔和源石打交道的历史也有很久了，倒是不至于那么慌乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......W呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "待在她自己的小队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你要去找她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......不确定。W变了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你以为W会因为失去特蕾西娅而性情大变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但她现在冷静得不像是W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过先前在战场上找到她的时候，她确实还是那副玩世不恭的嘴脸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "应该说比起过去有过之而无不及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真难得，你竟然能察觉到这种细微的违和感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......别讽刺我。如果W安静下来，那根本不算“细微”的违和感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "W她——啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "山的那一边，云在汇聚，气压的变化非常剧烈......那就是天灾云？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......这个规模，可能驻扎在这里也是不安全的，通知所有支队，按原路线后撤五十公里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "去找W，动作快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......别命令我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "W给我的感觉，和那个很像喔，现在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——啊啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "W！你在干什么——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里——风好大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还能干什么，欣赏天灾啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你疯了吗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你说什么？听——不——清——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啧，忘了你本来就是个疯子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别让你手下的萨卡兹陪你一起送命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我已经让他们跟着赫德雷撤离了啦，我又不蠢——啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "W！你给我小心点！嘁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你才是别过来喔，摔下去你可受不了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你就受得了吗？你要是不想死就给我回来——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你们两个搞什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你问她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是她非要碍着我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "幸亏W的队伍没有损失，否则在与整合运动的领袖合流之前，我们就要先上一趟军事法庭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "都先回去休息吧，等待通知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在天灾中作战又怎么样？你害怕矿石病吗？害怕风暴吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是单纯的不想死于非命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们都该提前适应一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这会是种有趣的体验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "伊内丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别这样，我没生气，又不是小孩子吵架要你来回哄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "W她......把队伍安置得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很难得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很难得......我都不知道她是更疯了，还是......她......哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她是个屁的天灾云，她就是个天灾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（粗口......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼哼哼~哼哼~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你心情好像很不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当然了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有些消息，就是要离开卡兹戴尔那个破地方才能打听到啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这也不是你把见面地点定在天灾云下面的理由吧......你是要我的命吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸，别这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你知道当一个疯子有什么好处吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不太想知道，但我其实已经知道了，毕竟我听你的，头儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这就对了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好处就是，你做的事情越不合逻辑，就越不会遭人质疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "罗德岛号的的确确离开了卡兹戴尔，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "准确来说，是没有情报表明这么大一艘舰船被殿......被特雷西斯纳入囊中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，还是有一些线索的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "队伍中的生面孔越来越多，我反倒安心起来，对自己离开了卡兹戴尔有了实感。\n同行者里，有敌人，也有战友，总是这样反复无常。\n雇佣兵是不会在意过去的，因为我们就是这样一个异常容易放下生死的种族。\n又或者是因为那场战争结束得太快，我们立刻就投身了下一个战场，未曾品尝过哪怕一秒的和平。\n......或许这种希望也只是某种毒药，我们始终需要斗争和冲突来缓和其平衡。\nW就是最好的例子，她早已甘之如饴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欢迎你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "远道而来的战士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "战争从来不是什么可以逃避的事物。\n这我知道，当然知道，只是到那一刻，我终于意识到。\n战争早已弥漫在这片大地的每个角落，从每个意志相互独立的生命诞生开始。\n而我们再度深陷其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
